From 5a98da0793d5cac466c74a299d4abdfb6dbfd15b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ebenezer <ebenezer@agrolink.local>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:32:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove decorative eyebrow/badge pills across public pages

Removed meaningless uppercase eyebrow labels (hero, section, about, auth,
dashboard, ai_daktari, price_intelligence) and their associated CSS rules
for a cleaner, more polished look (eBay/Google-style) instead of vibe-coded
decorative pills.

Files: index.html, about.html, developer.html, auth/login.html,
dashboard/dashboard.html, market/ai_daktari.html, market/price_intelligence.html,
base.html (shared .section-eyebrow rule)
